{"en": {"title": "Pink Nini Mug – MINI", "description": "The Nini mug is a small handmade jewel that combines Nordic design, charm and functionality. Made of high-quality stoneware, it stands out for its delicate shape and its cheerful striped decoration in pink and gray tones, which add a touch of color and vitality to any kitchen table or shelf.

Each mug is hand painted, meaning no two are the same. The slight variations in color and intensity are part of its beauty, reflecting the authenticity and care that characterize Bloomingville pieces. Its smooth finish and compact size make it ideal for enjoying a short coffee, an espresso or a relaxing infusion.

In addition to being practical, the Nini mug is a decorative element in itself. Place it next to other ceramic pieces on a shelf or display case to add a touch of artisanal and Nordic style to the environment. Its cheerful design and subtle coloring make it a perfect gift for those who enjoy small everyday details."}}

{"en": {"title": "Grottaglie Blue Ceramic Vase", "description": "This blue Grottaglie ceramic glass is handmade by Gianluca Annicchiarico, an artisan specialized in semi-finished products and ceramic pieces. Each piece is worked on the wheel in Grottaglie, province of Taranto, in Puglia, one of the great historical centers of Italian ceramics.

Its finish combines different intensities of blue, from deep tones to turquoise nuances, creating a surface full of reflections and variations. The artisanal process means that each glass presents small differences in shape, glaze and color, making it a unique piece.

Measuring approximately 17 × 16 cm, it stands out for its presence and a Mediterranean aesthetic with simple and contemporary lines. A piece that unites the ceramic tradition of Grottaglie with the character of handmade work in Italy."}}

{"en": {"title": "Hatty Chandelier in Blue and White", "description": "Made of stoneware, the Hatty candelabra stands out for its sober design but with a graphic nod. Its hand-painted blue strokes on the neutral base provide a feeling of calm and balance. Thanks to these colorful and simple details, it is a decorative piece that is very adaptable to any home style. As it is decorated by hand, the intensity and tone of the lines may vary slightly.

Hatty Chandelier Features:

Material: Ceramic"}}

{"en": {"title": "Ceramic Cactus - Wall Decoration", "description": "This decorative ceramic cactus, handcrafted in Grottaglie, Puglia, is a versatile piece designed to add color and character to any space. On the back it includes a small rope that allows it to be easily hung on the wall, although it can also be placed on a dresser, console or side table as a decorative object.

Due to its slightly concave shape, it can also be used as a pocket emptyer, a tray for keys, jewelry or other small everyday objects. A functional and decorative piece that keeps the small irregularities of artisanal work visible.

It is made by hand in Grottaglie, one of the towns most closely linked to the Italian ceramic tradition. Located in Puglia, the city preserves a strong artisanal identity in which historical workshops, traditional kilns, laboratories and new generations of ceramicists and contemporary artists coexist."}}

{"en": {"title": "Blue Saudade Tray. 38cm", "description": "This spectacular ceramic tray is made and painted by hand. It is perfect to serve in the center of the table, as a salad bowl or as a decorative element. You can present a dessert, starters or a centerpiece to share.

Each unit presents subtle variations typical of its manual manufacture, which makes each piece a unique and unrepeatable object.

Technical sheet"}}

{"en": {"title": "Saudade Sol Fountain - 28cm", "description": "piece a special object both for the table and for decoration.

Measuring 28 cm long x 17.5 cm wide, it is ideal for presenting starters, appetizers, side dishes or small dishes in the center of the table. It can also be used as a baking dish, as long as the finish and the piece are indicated for this, or as a decorative plate to add color and personality to any space.

A versatile piece that unites functionality, craftsmanship and the characteristic graphic language of the Portuguese studio OLLARUS."}}

{"en": {"title": "Salt and Sugar Bowl from Fajaluza, Granada", "description": "This special piece is original from the Fábrica de Arrayanes de Granada, Spain. It is hand painted on clay, it is ideal for keeping sugar or salt at the correct temperature. Its dimensions are 11 x15 centimeters, perfect for storing and serving in a comfortable and stylish way.

Available in Pink and Blue, combining craftsmanship with touches of color and design.

Perfect for everyday use or for special occasions."}}

{"en": {"title": "Water Jug - White & Black", "description": "Ceramic water jug ​​from the Ollarus design studio. Effective at preserving water at room temperature. Black cross design in the center of the jug.

Measurements: (D)-13.00cm (W)-20.50cm

Capacity: 1.2L"}}

{"en": {"title": "Fixed Candelabra - ceramic green", "description": "The Bloomingville Fija chandelier is the perfect complement to bring warmth and style to any corner of the home. Its characteristic shape and elegant bright green enamel give it a unique personality, making it a decorative piece that stands out both on and off.

Ideal for creating cozy environments, the Fija candle holder looks especially beautiful on a window sill, among houseplants and bouquets of flowers, where its enamelled finish subtly reflects natural light. It is also perfect for decorating shelves, side tables or centerpieces, adding a touch of color and sophistication.

A versatile piece that combines functionality and design, designed for those who want to incorporate small details with charm and character in their decoration."}}

{"en": {"title": "Pedestal Bob fruit bowl, Ibizan style", "description": "This fruit bowl is perfect to transform into an attractive centerpiece or a decorative piece with a lot of personality. In addition, it is very useful for keeping the pantry organized.

Capacity:1200ml

The Bob fruit bowl from Bloomingville is made of stoneware and has a delicate hand-painted finish in pink, yellow and blue tones, which adds freshness and personality to the piece. Its design with a raised base not only gives it height and presence, but also reinforces its decorative and casual character. Ideal for both functional use and display, this plate combines craftsmanship and contemporary design. The subtle variations in color and paint stroke reflect manual work and turn each piece into a unique object."}}

{"en": {"title": "Complete Tableware - Green Repainted - Granada Ceramics", "description": "We have the perfect tableware for your home, the ceramic plates and dishes from the Arrayanes factory offer you color and craftsmanship in your home, dress your table like never before.

We offer you a set of tableware for 6 people with three pieces per person and a salad bowl-sized plate for the center. In total a 19-piece high-quality tableware set.

*FREE SHIPPING for this product by applying the purchase code: FREE75"}}

{"en": {"title": "Dorothy Pink Plate", "description": "The Bloomingville Dorothy Plate is an authentic decorative jewel made of high-quality stoneware. Its embossed surface features a colorful floral motif in red, blue, pink and green tones, which gives it an appearance similar to handmade embroidery, creating an incredible texture to the touch and sight.

The soft pink edge adds a touch of elegance and delicacy, making it a perfect piece both to use on the table and to decorate any corner of the home.

A unique and textured plate that combines art, color and elegance in every detail."}}

{"en": {"title": "Red Plate - Latina Small - 20cm", "description": "The Latina Plate is made of glazed stoneware with a deep red tone that brings warmth and style to any table. Its wavy edges give it texture and an elegant and distinctive touch.

Thanks to its large size, it is perfect as a main dish for everyday meals or special dinners. Handmade enamelling may present slight color variations, making each piece unique.

✨ An elegant dish with personality, ideal to enhance any table."}}

{"en": {"title": "Red Bowl - Latina - 12cm", "description": "The Latina Bowl combines simplicity and elegance in a handmade design with a beautiful red enamel. Its practical size makes it ideal for breakfast, as well as for serving appetizers or sweet and savory snacks.

The enamelled finish may present slight color variations, which gives each piece a unique and special character.

A versatile, colorful and charming bowl to enjoy every moment at the table."}}

