Technique: High temperature vitrified ceramic."}}

{"en": {"title": "porcelain salt shaker", "description": "This porcelain salt shaker has been meticulously designed to complement traditional kitchens. Each piece is unique, since they are made by hand with artisanal techniques, which guarantees that no two salt shakers are identical.

The attention to detail in its creation is reflected in its elegant and functional design, ideal for those who value authenticity and quality in their kitchen utensils. Furthermore, its delicate and refined finish brings a touch of sophistication and charm to any kitchen, becoming not only a practical utensil, but also a decorative piece that highlights the character and personality of the culinary space.

Technique: High temperature vitrified ceramic."}}

