{"en": {"title": "Ceramic cup set", "description": "The glasses are handcrafted and decorated by hand in the craft studio of MARTINEZ COELLO, an artist whose pictorial work is represented in the most important museums and private collections in Spain, USA, Mexico, Italy, Brazil, Venezuela, France, Portugal...

Coello uses PORCELAIN for his designs, a noble ceramic material, fired at high temperature (1,300%). Each piece is unique and has been made entirely by hand, which gives it the character of a work of art.

These original green and yellow glasses are essential to complete the set of pieces from the Silvestre collection. They are used to accompany coffee with water or take a small sip of liquor."}}
